{"ref":"BDB, אִסָּר","hw":"אִסָּר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אִסָּר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:8\" href=\"/Numbers.30.8\">Nu 30:8</a></sup> <strong>bond, binding obligation (</strong>cf. Biblical Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱבָר</span>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܶܣܳܪ</span>; so forms with suff. infr. v. Ba<sup>NB62</sup> cf. Sta<sup>§ 208a</sup>; but perhaps Aramaic loanword v. Lag<sup>BN 175</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:3\" href=\"/Numbers.30.3\">Nu 30:3</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִסַּר</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:13\" href=\"/Numbers.30.13\">13</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱסָרָהּ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:5\" href=\"/Numbers.30.5\">5</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱסָרֶיהָ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:6\" href=\"/Numbers.30.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:15\" href=\"/Numbers.30.15\">15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱסָרֶהָ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:8\" href=\"/Numbers.30.8\">8</a>—only <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30\" href=\"/Numbers.30\">Nu 30</a> (P), <em>binding obligation</em> of oath or vow; mostly acc. cogn. with <span dir=\"rtl\">אָסַר</span> (q.v.); <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:3\" href=\"/Numbers.30.3\">Nu 30:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:4\" href=\"/Numbers.30.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:5\" href=\"/Numbers.30.5\">5</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:6\" href=\"/Numbers.30.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:8\" href=\"/Numbers.30.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:11\" href=\"/Numbers.30.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:12\" href=\"/Numbers.30.12\">12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אִסַּר נַפְשָׁהּ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:13\" href=\"/Numbers.30.13\">13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבֻעַת אִסָּר</span> <em>binding oath</em> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:14\" href=\"/Numbers.30.14\">14</a>.","next":"BDB, מָסֹ֫רֶת","prev":"BDB, אַסִּיר²"}